  "details": "This is something that's been on my mind forever now, and I thought this was something that was suggested in detail before. I think that there is absolutely ZERO reason for VRChat to not add avatar cameras to the Safety system. The only reason this restriction is set in the first place is because this was a hotfix made to prevent malicious use of cameras before the Safety system was ever conceived, and now that we have something like this, there theoretically should be nothing that's really stopping the development of a feature like this.",
